:[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[0,0,0,0.0],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.115,"r5":-0.024,"r1_spy":-0.118,"r5_spy":-0.0248}}],"quotes":[{"c":"PAY 2017 Q4","e":"pay","d":"2017-12-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marc Rothman","x":"…operating expenses were $131 million, down sequentially and also, reflect a $5 million or 3.5% reduction, compared with the prior year, driven by our focus on restructuring and efficiency initiatives, including operating system consolidations as well as streamlining back office operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/12/13/verifone-systems-inc-pay-q4-2017-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"PAY 2017 Q4","e":"pay","d":"2017-12-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Marc Rothman","x":"Going forward, as we complete previous restructuring-related activities, our free cash flow conversion profile will continue to improve into a target range of now 80% to 85%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/12/13/verifone-systems-inc-pay-q4-2017-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"PAY 2021 Q3","e":"pay","d":"2021-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Parson","x":"We are quite pleased to be able to raise our full year outlook for revenue and contribution profit, as well as reaffirm our full year outlook for adjusted EBITDA to be at the top end of the previously provided range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/10/verifone-holdings-pay-q3-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q1","e":"pay","d":"2022-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dushyant Sharma","x":"And we're not raising our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/05/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q1","e":"pay","d":"2022-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Parson","x":"Does the fact that we had to, you know, kind of exceeded expectations in Q1 and raise our guidance, does it change kind of our thinking for the rest of the year and how the quarters play out?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/05/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q1-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q2","e":"pay","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Davis","x":"I just want to start talking a little bit about inflation and what kind of lag, obviously, when you're -- some of your costs and interchange in basis points, do you have to give 30, 60, 90 days' notice to raise price on a per-transaction basis?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q2","e":"pay","d":"2022-08-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Davis","x":"Just trying to understand, I think when we talked in the IPO, the thought was that inflation would be relatively flat minus some timing differences as far as the impact on your P&L. So just curious kind of what that timing delay looks like for your ability to raise price to offset inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q2","e":"pay","d":"2022-08-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dushyant Sharma","x":"And look, we have been in business for a long time, and the bottom line is, I don't like to lower guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/04/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q2-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2022 Q3","e":"pay","d":"2022-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"John Davis","x":"And then, nice to see the upside this quarter, just reiterate the guide.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/09/paymentus-holdings-inc-pay-q3-2022-earnings-call-t/"},{"c":"PAY 2023 Q2","e":"pay","d":"2023-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sanjay Kalra","x":"We are encouraged by the results of our repricing actions w